{"id":"1be181e56e937ecb","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-sentence.md","title":"闭公式","display":"df-sentence — 闭公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-sentence","aliases":["43-df-sentence"],"display":"df-sentence — 闭公式","depends_on":["[[43-df-formula]]","[[43-df-free-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sentence — 闭公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a4ba10013f4fc82\" href=\"?note=1a4ba10013f4fc82\" title=\"43-df-formula\">43-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16154750d33f58cc\" href=\"?note=16154750d33f58cc\" title=\"43-df-free-variable\">43-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为候选公式对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16154750d33f58cc\" href=\"?note=16154750d33f58cc\" title=\"43-df-free-variable\">43-df-free-variable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_L:=\\{\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L:\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Sentence}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sent}_L:=\\{\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L:\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Sentence}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭公式没有自由变量；所有量词作用于语法树上的绑定位置。</p>\n<p>来源：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的一阶逻辑基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1a4ba10013f4fc82","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"16154750d33f58cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"16154750d33f58cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$ 固定；$\\varphi$ 为候选公式对象，$\\operatorname{FV}_L$ 见 [[43-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_L","display":